[0.014, "o", "---\r\ntitle: \"Nix/Rix Example\"\r\nauthor: Jason Geller\r\nformat:\r\n  html: default\r\n  typst: default\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Load Packages\r\n\r\n```{r}\r\nlibrary(palmerpenguins) # data\r\nlibrary(brms) # run bayesian model\r\nlibrary(cmdstanr) # cmdstan backend \r\n```\r\n\r\n## Run Model\r\n\r\nNow we will run this Bayesian model\r\n\r\n```{r}\r\n\r\nmodel_normal <- brm(body_mass_g ~ flipper_length_mm,\r\n  family = gaussian(),\r\n  backend=\"cmdstanr\", \r\n  data = penguins\r\n)\r\n\r\n```\r\n"]
